  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SILC PAO 2023-2027 - SILC PAO 2023-2027 - ISK</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SILC PAO 2023-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att bidra till; 
- starkare partisystem genom att st&#xe4;rka partipartnernas representativitet, ideologiska f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;gbarhet och f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att driva reformer;
- demokratiska, inkluderande och v&#xe4;lfungerande politiska organisationer och &#xe4;ndam&#xe5;lsenliga samarbeten inom plattformar och n&#xe4;tverk f&#xf6;r politisk dialog;
- &#xf6;kad representation, delaktighet och inflytande i politiska organisationer f&#xf6;r de som &#xe4;r underrepresenterade, inklusive kvinnor och ungdomar, och;
- st&#xe4;rka kopplingarna till den svenska resursbasen genom att sprida kunskap om och intresse f&#xf6;r aktiviteterna</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Silc aims to;
- contribute to stronger party systems by strengthening party representativeness, ideological predictability and ability to drive reforms;
- democratic, inclusive and well-functioning political organizations and effective collaborations within platforms and networks for political dialogue;
- increased representation, participation and influence in political organizations of those who are underrepresented, including women and young people, and;
- strengthen the links to the Swedish resource base by spreading knowledge about and interest in activities</narrative>
  </description>
